      "writtenOn": "2022-10-21T20:02:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We could disable init_on_alloc outside the for loop, to reduce the amount of toggling. But from your tests it sounds like it\u0027s not much overhead?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 232,
        "startChar": 1,
